{
    "openapi": "3.0.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "TempoFast API — Standalone Auth",
        "description": "## TempoFast — Standalone Authentication API\n\nEmail/password authentication for the TempoFast service.\n\n### Endpoints\n| Method | Endpoint | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------------|\n| POST | `/api/v1/auth/register` | Register a new account |\n| POST | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Login with email & password |\n| POST | `/api/v1/auth/logout` | Logout (revoke current token) |\n| GET | `/api/v1/auth/user` | Get current user profile |\n\n### Authentication\n\nAll protected endpoints require a Bearer token in the `Authorization` header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\n```\n\n**How to get a token:**\n1. Call `POST /api/v1/auth/login` or `POST /api/v1/auth/register` with `device_name` parameter\n2. Use the returned `token` in subsequent requests\n\n**Session-based auth (web):**\nOmit `device_name` → a session cookie is set automatically (for SPA with same-origin).\n\n### Token Lifecycle\n- Each `device_name` creates an independent token\n- `POST /api/v1/auth/logout` revokes only the **current** token (other devices stay logged in)\n- Tokens do not expire automatically (revoke explicitly on logout)\n\n### Error Format\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": \"ERROR_CODE\",\n  \"message\": \"Human-readable description\"\n}\n```\nValidation errors (422):\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"The email field is required.\",\n  \"errors\": { \"email\": [\"The email field is required.\"] }\n}\n```",
        "contact": {
            "name": "TempoFast"
        },
        "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "http://localhost:5400",
            "description": "Local Development"
        }
    ],
    "paths": {
        "/api/v1/auth/login": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Login with email & password",
                "description": "Authenticate a user with email and password (standalone mode).\n\n**With `device_name`**: Returns a Sanctum API token for mobile/SPA apps.\n**Without `device_name`**: Creates a session (cookie-based auth for web).",
                "operationId": "c99bdfd067de5ad8950a4ef4cbef1406",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "required": [
                                    "email",
                                    "password"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "email": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "email",
                                        "example": "user@example.com"
                                    },
                                    "password": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password",
                                        "example": "password123"
                                    },
                                    "device_name": {
                                        "description": "Device name for API token auth. Omit for session/cookie auth.",
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "iPhone 15",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Login successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid",
                                                            "example": "019d4e6a-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc"
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email",
                                                            "example": "user@example.com"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "example": "田中 太郎"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "token": {
                                                    "description": "Sanctum API token (only returned when device_name is provided)",
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "example": "1|abc123xyz...",
                                                    "nullable": true
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Invalid credentials",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "error": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS"
                                        },
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "The provided credentials are incorrect."
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "Account disabled",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "error": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "ACCOUNT_DISABLED"
                                        },
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Your account has been disabled."
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "The email field is required."
                                        },
                                        "errors": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "example": "{\"email\": [\"The email field is required.\"]}"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/register": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Register a new account",
                "description": "Create a new user account (standalone mode only).\n\nThis endpoint may be disabled via configuration (`dxs-sso.standalone.registration = false`).\n\n**With `device_name`**: Returns a Sanctum API token.\n**Without `device_name`**: Creates a session (cookie-based auth).",
                "operationId": "17ef4c276b0f125a91a8356a1d7e1ea5",
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "required": [
                                    "name",
                                    "email",
                                    "password",
                                    "password_confirmation"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "maxLength": 255,
                                        "example": "田中 太郎"
                                    },
                                    "email": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "email",
                                        "maxLength": 255,
                                        "example": "user@example.com"
                                    },
                                    "password": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password",
                                        "minLength": 8,
                                        "example": "password123"
                                    },
                                    "password_confirmation": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "password",
                                        "example": "password123"
                                    },
                                    "device_name": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "example": "iPhone 15",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "object"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "201": {
                        "description": "Registration successful",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                },
                                                "token": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "nullable": true
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation error (duplicate email, weak password, etc.)",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "errors": {
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/logout": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Logout",
                "description": "Logout the current user.\n\n- **Bearer token auth**: Revokes the current API token only (other device tokens remain active).\n- **Session auth**: Destroys the session.",
                "operationId": "701698ad6a92079bfcb81ed22d4d02fc",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Logged out successfully",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Logged out successfully"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthenticated"
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "sanctum": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        "/api/v1/auth/user": {
            "get": {
                "tags": [
                    "Auth — Standalone"
                ],
                "summary": "Get current user",
                "description": "Returns the authenticated user's profile information.",
                "operationId": "ac428264909ac726eb44134f36d83e29",
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "User info",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "data": {
                                            "properties": {
                                                "user": {
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "id": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "uuid"
                                                        },
                                                        "email": {
                                                            "type": "string",
                                                            "format": "email"
                                                        },
                                                        "name": {
                                                            "type": "string"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "type": "object"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "type": "object"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthenticated"
                    }
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "sanctum": []
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "components": {
        "securitySchemes": {
            "sanctum": {
                "type": "http",
                "description": "Bearer token from login or SSO callback",
                "scheme": "bearer",
                "bearerFormat": "Token"
            }
        }
    },
    "tags": [
        {
            "name": "Auth — Standalone",
            "description": "Email/password authentication"
        }
    ]
}